<v Mike>Mac Venture. Yeah, I'm not sure.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:31.740
<v Mike>I don't know enough about the history of these to know why that's called that.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:33.380
<v Mike>But it's like maybe that's the.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.580
<v Mike>Company or maybe that's.

