01:34:45.940 --> 01:34:53.120
<v Sean>I like, I think it feels, it feels more, uh, it feels more cerebral than that.

01:34:53.300 --> 01:34:57.260
<v Mike>What if it was solve a murder mystery or defeat Satan twice?

01:34:57.260 --> 01:35:01.080
<v Mike>Nice. That's true.

01:35:01.440 --> 01:35:02.600
<v Sean>You got it there. There you go.

01:35:02.700 --> 01:35:07.260
<v Mike>All right. Uh, no, no, I, I am very impressed by this game.

01:35:07.620 --> 01:35:11.440
